---
import { Image } from 'astro:assets';
import nasaImage from '../assets/nasa.jpg';
import { MY_EMAIL } from '../consts';
import Section from './Section.astro';
---
<Section id="aboutme" name="Curiosity is the fuel.">
  <div class="about-grid">
    <figure class="about-photo"><Image src={nasaImage} alt="Space shuttle mounted on a Boeing 747, photographed by Viswa" width={800} loading="lazy" /><figcaption>FIELD NOTES / THROUGH MY LENS <span>↗</span></figcaption></figure>
    <div class="about-copy">
      <p class="about-lead">Hey, I’m Viswa.<br />An engineer with a very<br /><span>upward-looking imagination.</span></p>
      <p>I study <a href="https://www.imperial.ac.uk/study/courses/undergraduate/electronic-information-meng/">Electronic and Information Engineering</a> at <a href="https://imperial.ac.uk/">Imperial College London</a>. My interests span rocketry, robotics, FPGAs, and quantum computing.</p>
      <p>I want to develop robotics for interstellar travel, explore FPGAs for robotics and experimental physics, and help advance quantum computing. Right now, that curiosity takes me from software to circuit boards to rocket ground systems.</p>
      <p>Away from engineering, I’m a <a href="/publications">writer</a>, calisthenics enjoyer, and <a href="/photography">photographer</a>. The shuttle photo? That one’s mine.</p>
      <details class="personal-history"><summary>A little more background <span aria-hidden="true">+</span></summary><p>I completed the International Baccalaureate Diploma Programme with 40/45 points and a 7 in every Higher Level subject. It sparked my interest in academic research: modelling populations with differential equations and simplex-based optimisations, and experimenting with Euler’s pendulum and Lagrangian mechanics.</p></details>
      <div class="about-links"><a href={`mailto:${MY_EMAIL}`}>Email ↗</a><a href="/data/cv.pdf">CV ↗</a><a href="https://github.com/justanotherbyte">GitHub ↗</a><a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/mviswa/">LinkedIn ↗</a><a href="https://x.com/justanotherbyte">X ↗</a></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</Section>
